# Note: This app is browser-only and cannot read .env files.
# This file is for reference only - the app uses:

# - OCR.space: Key is embedded (base64 encoded) in script.js
# - Google Vision: Enter your key in the UI input field
#
# Keeping this file for potential future backend implementation.

# Google Vision API Key (requires billing enabled)
# Get it at: https://console.cloud.google.com
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# OCR.space API Key (free, no billing required)  
# Get it at: https://ocr.space/ocrapi
# OCRSPACE_API_KEY=your_ocrspace_api_key_here
